      "name": "gauge-metric",
      "substitute": "gauge",
      "reason": "gauge-metric does not exist in Lucide 1.52.0, so gauge.svg answers the gauge semantic. No other set is acceptable: an absent glyph is the moment an agent reaches for a set that has it, and the set that has it is simple-icons, which is CC0 and therefore looks safe while shipping tesla.svg. The closed 33-entry list above and fetch_upstream.sh's two-URL allow-list are what make reaching impossible rather than discouraged."
